# Phase 7 – Project Documentation

## Project Title

Implement Client Script & UI Policy (Incident)

## Purpose

The purpose of this project is to improve the ServiceNow Incident form by dynamically controlling field behavior using Client Scripts and UI Policies.

## Technologies Used

- ServiceNow
- JavaScript
- Client Script
- UI Policy
- Incident Management

## Benefits

- Improves user experience.
- Reduces incorrect data entry.
- Dynamically controls form fields.
- Makes fields mandatory when required.
- Improves form usability.
- Reduces unnecessary manual validation.

## Project Outcome

The project successfully demonstrates the implementation of Client Script and UI Policy on the ServiceNow Incident form.

## Conclusion

Client Scripts and UI Policies provide an effective way to dynamically control Incident form behavior in ServiceNow. The implementation helps create a more structured and user-friendly Incident Management process.
